    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2032852889375485987",
      "url": "https://x.com/hydcitypolice/status/2032852889375485987",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/hydcitypolice/status/2032852889375485987",
      "text": "𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰 𝗮𝗱𝘃𝗶𝘀𝗼𝗿𝘆 𝗶𝘀𝘀𝘂𝗲𝗱 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗽𝗿𝗲-𝗿𝗲𝗹𝗲𝗮𝘀𝗲 𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗼𝗳 𝗨𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗮𝗱 𝗕𝗵𝗮𝗴𝗮𝘁 𝗦𝗶𝗻𝗴𝗵 𝗮𝘁 𝗞𝗼𝘁𝗹𝗮 𝗩𝗶𝗷𝗮𝘆𝗮 𝗕𝗵𝗮𝘀𝗸𝗲𝗿 𝗥𝗲𝗱𝗱𝘆 𝗦𝘁𝗮𝗱𝗶𝘂𝗺 𝗼𝗻 𝗠𝗮𝗿𝗰𝗵 𝟭𝟱.\n\nHyderabad Traffic Police inform that traffic congestion is expected on March 15 from 3 PM to 10 PM due to the pre-release event of Ustaad Bhagat Singh at the Police Grounds, 1st Battalion near Kotla Vijaya Bhasker Reddy Stadium, Yousufguda. A large number of people are expected to attend the event. Commuters are advised to avoid roads towards the stadium and use alternative routes.\n\n𝗗𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀:\n\nTraffic from Jubilee Hills Check Post towards KVBR Stadium will be diverted at Krishna Nagar Junction towards Srinagar Colony – Panjagutta.\n\nTraffic from Maitrivanam Junction towards Jubilee Hills Check Post / Madhapur will be diverted at Yousufguda Basti towards RBI Quarters – Krishna Nagar Junction – Jubilee Hills Check Post.\n\nTraffic from Maitrivanam Junction towards Borabanda Bus Stop will be diverted via Savera Function Hall – Krishnakanth Park – GTS Temple – Kalyan Nagar – Moti Nagar – Borabanda Bus Stop.\n\nTraffic from Borabanda Bus Stop towards Maitrivanam Junction will be diverted via Prime Garden Kalyan Nagar – Midland Bakery – GTS Colony – Kalyan Nagar Junction – Umesh Chandra Statue U-Turn – ICICI U-Turn – Maitrivanam Junction.\n\n𝗣𝗮𝗿𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗿𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗴𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝘀:\n\nJanakammathota Parking, Yousufguda – 2 & 4 wheelers\n\nMetro Parking, Yousufguda – 2 & 4 wheelers\n\nSavera Function Hall, Yousufguda – 4 wheelers only\n\nMahamood Function Hall, Yousufguda – 4 wheelers only",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
